{"id":597,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Mossy caves are their preferred dwellings. Enzymes contained in mosses help Ferroseed’s spikes grow big and strong."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It defends itself by launching spikes, but its aim isn’t very good at first. Only after a lot of practice will it improve."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It absorbs the iron it finds in the rock while clinging to the ceiling. It shoots spikes when in danger."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Black"],"text":"When threatened, it attacks by shooting a barrage of spikes, which gives it a chance to escape by rolling away."},{"games":["White"],"text":"They stick their spikes into cave walls and absorb the minerals they find in the rock."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Iron Barbs","hidden":false,"description":"Inflicts damage on the attacker upon contact with iron barbs."}],"eggGroups":["Grass","Mineral"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Gray","shape":"Ball","evolution":{"id":597,"name":"Ferroseed","condition":null,"children":[{"id":598,"name":"Ferrothorn","condition":"Lv. 40","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,33],[1,106],[5,232],[10,42],[15,275],[20,430],[25,442],[30,120],[35,334],[41,174],[45,360],[50,153]],"machine":[372,213,331,203,412,263,430,202,360,334,442,371,42,398,182,156,279,496,402,120,214,173,76,191,446,164,241,86,85],"egg":[491,356,282,73,92],"tutor":[796,798]},"cards":[{"id":"rsv10pt5-148","name":"Ferroseed","set":"White Flare","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"148","artist":"Nurikabe","img":"rsv10pt5/148"},{"id":"me4-62","name":"Ferroseed","set":"Chaos Rising","date":"2026-05-22","rarity":"Common","number":"62","artist":"OKUBO","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-62/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-62/large"},{"id":"rsv10pt5-68","name":"Ferroseed","set":"White Flare","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Co